package {{PACKAGE}}

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// SHARED FILE. This is copied verbatim into every export as
// assets/export/kt/NativeComponents.kt.tmpl -- only the package line differs
// (tools/sync_export_templates.sh does the swap). Keep it depending on nothing
// but Compose, org.json, `parseHexColor` and `materialIcon`, which exist in
// both the builder and the generated app.
//
// Everything a page can open natively lives here: confirm / alert / prompt
// dialogs, action sheets, single- and multi-select sheets, date, date-range
// and time pickers, the snackbar and the loading overlay.
//
// NOTHING here is a fixed look. Every colour, text size, weight, corner radius
// and the font family come from the manifest's `components` block, and any
// single call can override any of them, so a native component can always be
// made to match the app around it.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

